    "bodyEn": "Case results become useful when they are aggregated and compared with a baseline under an explicit policy. This part builds a suite report with first-pass and repair rates, a release gate with category, critical and attempt limits, an ERROR status for unusable evidence, a real process exit code, a paired comparison, a view of small-suite noise, and failure injection into the gate itself.",
